```css
.popup {
  max-width: 400px;
  background: var(--color-white);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-gray-300);
  border-radius: 8px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(42, 52, 64, 0.12);
  padding: var(--space-6);
  animation: popupFadeIn 0.25s var(--ease-default);
}

@keyframes popupFadeIn {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-8px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}
```

